  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Saltimbocca alla Romana pairs thin veal "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "escalopes",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "escalope"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with prosciutto and sage, then cooks them fast in a hot pan before "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "deglazing",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "deglazing"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " with dry white wine to make a light pan sauce. The whole dish is on the table in under 20 minutes. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Keep the heat high so the prosciutto crisps and the veal colours without stewing. Overcrowding the pan is the main thing to avoid."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "veal-shoulder",
              "amount": 600,
              "unit": "g",
              "prepNote": "cut into 8 thin escalopes and beaten flat",
              "isOptional": false,
              "groupLabel": null
            },
            {
              "ingredientSlug": "prosciutto",
              "amount": 8,
              "unit": "slices",
